cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: FCS Prep
abstract: The first step of the immune cytometry workflows. Reads FCS files (conventional, spectral or
  mass cytometry), works out the common panel, compensates when needed, pre-gates raw mass cytometry
  (beads, DNA, viability) and arcsinh-transforms the marker channels with FlowKit, writing one FCS 3.1
  file per sample plus the sample sheet and panel for the steps that follow.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-fcs-prep
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- spectral-flow
- mass-cytometry
- fcs
- preprocessing
- immunology
